<title>POLAND: Polish KPW clears Farm Food rights issue.</title>
<headline>Polish KPW clears Farm Food rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Securities Commission (KPW) cleared 600,000 one-for-five rights issue of food producer Farm Food SA, KPW said in a statement.</p>
<p>The funds from the issue were earmarked for equity investments in meat industry.</p>
<p>The rights first leg would be held from January 2-23 and second leg from February 13 to February 27 next year.</p>
<p>The issue will be available for shareholders of record as of December 23.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
